      "html" : "<\/div><div class=\"clearfix\"><\/div><div id=\"rid-0-0-0-163759\" class=\"rbox Normal-Level\"><AnnotationDrawer recordId=\"0-0-0-163759\"><\/AnnotationDrawer><div><span style=\"color: #000000;font-weight: normal;font-style: normal;text-decoration:none;display: inline;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,serif;font-size:10pt;\">On-site nonpotable water reuse systems shall utilize drainage piping approved for use in plumbing drainage systems to collect and convey untreated water for reuse. Vent piping approved<\/span><span style=\"color: #000000;font-weight: normal;font-style: italic;text-decoration:none;display: inline;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,serif;font-size:10pt;\">&#160;<\/span><span style=\"color: #000000;font-weight: normal;font-style: normal;text-decoration:none;display: inline;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,serif;font-size:10pt;\">for use in plumbing venting systems shall be utilized for vents in the nonpotable system. Collection and vent piping materials shall comply with Section <\/span><span style=\"font-weight: normal;font-style: normal;text-decoration:none;display: inline;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,serif;font-size:10pt;\"><Link class=\"Jump\" to=\"{{ pathname: '\/codes\/newyorkcity\/latest\/NYCadmin\/0-0-0-162474', hash: '#JD_PC702' }}\">702<\/Link><\/span><span style=\"color: #000000;font-weight: normal;font-style: normal;text-decoration:none;display: inline;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,serif;font-size:10pt;\">, <\/span><span style=\"font-weight: normal;font-style: normal;text-decoration:none;display: inline;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,serif;font-size:10pt;\"><Link class=\"Jump\" to=\"{{ pathname: '\/codes\/newyorkcity\/latest\/NYCadmin\/0-0-0-162475', hash: '#JD_PCTable702.1' }}\">Table 702.1<\/Link><\/span><span style=\"color: #000000;font-weight: normal;font-style: normal;text-decoration:none;display: inline;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,serif;font-size:10pt;\"> and <\/span><span style=\"font-weight: normal;font-style: normal;text-